    "chunk_text": "\u00feurh Ac utan we gemunan hu ure yldran, \u00fea \u00e6restan men, \u00feurh hwylc \u00feing hie \u00f0a eadelican life forworhton Efene hie w\u00e6ron \u00feurh oferhygdnesse, & \u00feurh ungehyrsumnesse & \u00feurh \u00fea lufan \u00fe\u00e6s idlan wuldres & & nu se man se \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feence\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he of \u00feysse gehrorenlican worulde \u00feone heofonlican rice begite, he He sceal beon \u00feonne ea\u00f0mod on his heortan & hersum to \u00e6lcum men & to Gode, & he sceal \u00feysse Efne he sceal eac \u00fea lufian for Godes naman \u00fea \u00fee him wi\u00f0erwearde synd, & he sceal halige w\u00e6ccan He sceal f\u00e6sten begangan & \u00fea lufian mid cl\u00e6ne \u00e6lmessan & mid mycle forwyr\u00f0nesse habban on his & he sceall beon \u00e6lmesgeorn for Godes naman & for his sawle. \u00feurh \u00feas lare, bro\u00f0or mine, & \u00feurh \u00f0as d\u00e6da, \u00fea \u00fee ure m\u00e6ssepreostas us t\u00e6ca\u00fe & l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00feonne Ac uton we nu for \u00fean, men \u00fea leofestan, ure sylfra lif mid mycle egesan & mid mycle behygdnesse & mid \u00feyllicum d\u00e6dum we magon \u00fea heofonlican rice begitan & on becuman, mid urne dryhten,.",
